   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Figure 1: Representative illusion of the mfloDxâ„¢ MDR-TB lateral flow cassette. WT indicates Mycobacterium tuberculosis complex identity and the detection of the wild-type allele of the resistance-coding gene. Mutant type (MUT) indicates detection of mutations in the respective genes and the hybridization control. IC indicatesthe detection of internal control in both wild type and MUT. MTC: Mycobacterium tuberculosis complex, WT: Wild type, HC: Hybridization control, IC: Internal control, MUT: Mutant type, M. tuberculosis: Mycobacterium tuberculosis</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
